acticed.\" #fcblive", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116615756418805895", "text": "Injured but still with the team \u2764", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV-60GqXsAAYBUa.jpg"}, {"id": "2116621731829801252", "text": "The team ahead of kickoff. \u2764\ufe0f", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2116621593392930816/vid/avc1/1280x720/2x0fQwUhpbVt7koA.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2116622251453796829", "text": "1' KICKOFF. \ud83d\udc99\u2764\ufe0f", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116623742096851422", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83d\udcf8 | Christensen, Espart, Eric and Olmo. #fcblive \ud83d\ude22", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV_CE8_XEAE8oDs.jpg"}, {"id": "2116624118422388863", "text": "GOOOOOAAAAAAAALBAR\u00c7A 1-0. \ud83d\udc99\u2764\ufe0f", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116624370260955353", "text": "RAPHINHA OPENS THE SCORE. FERM\u00cdN LAYS IT BEAUTIFUL FOR THE BRAZILIAN WHO TAPS IT HOME. 1-0. \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7\ud83d\udd25", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116624910139175255", "text": "Pedri \ud83c\udfa9\ud83d\udcab", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116625086233059601", "text": "His vision is UNRIVALLED \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83d\udcab", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2116624871820230656/vid/avc1/1280x720/Im45VQxvydxM8cmI.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2116625284883431681", "text": "11' Joan Garcia SAVES. \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116625861554188518", "text": "Rodri says NO \u274c", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2116625744218787840/vid/avc1/1280x720/cmDJ4m6TxwLqvMiO.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2116627851411657169", "text": "FERM\u00cdN MAKES IT 2-0. SPOTIFY CAMP NOU ERUPTS. \ud83d\udc99\u2764\ufe0f", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116628653542981884", "text": "25' Lamine with a tight chance but it goes straight into the keeper. #fcblive", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116630774824743192", "text": "33' RAPHINHA WITH A HUGE MISS. #fcblive \u274c", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116631011828150761", "text": "34' Lamine ALSO WITH A HUGE MISS. Adeyemi bursts pasts the Alav\u00e9s defense to lay it onto Lamine who's shot gets SAVED. \u274c", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116631441266078011", "text": "36' SAVE by Joan Garcia. \u2705", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116633815997198394", "text": "LAMINE MAKES IT 4-0. ITS RAINING GOALS TODAY. \ud83d\udd25", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2116634339895042275", "text": "\ud83c\udfa5 | \ud835\udc16\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc13 \ud835\udc00 \ud835\udc12\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc04 \ud835\udc05\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc0c \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc04! 4-0 Bar\u00e7aaaaaa. \ud83d\udd25", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2116633514678292480/vid/avc1/1280x720/27FVwZLdIjyBGXQg.mp4?tag=14"}, {"id": "2116634516974387458", "text": "LAMINE GOLAZOOO \ud83d\ude80", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2116634330839801856/vid/avc1/1280x720/vZ1_6AJWwiZiPDZ2.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2116634554073026760", "text": "HT: Bar\u00e7a \ud835\udfd2-\ud835\udfce Alaves \n\nBar\u00e7a with a DOMINANT performance at the break. #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV_L6QHXIAAEWf6.jpg"}, {"id": "2116636075317768262", "text": "\ud835\udfcf\ud835\udc06 + \ud835\udfd0\ud835\udc00.\n\nWhat a half by Ferm\u00edn \ud83d\udd25", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV_NS0PXYAAq9Sy.jpg"}, {"id": "2116636675698831748", "text": "We missed you \ud83e\udd79\u2764\ufe0f", "med